  {
    "id": 1022001020020,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………な、なんでしょう……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "悪い、驚かせちゃったな\r\nちょっといいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020030,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに警戒しなくても大丈夫だ\r\n別に怒ったり叱ったりするわけじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020040,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………は、はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、これ……２８３プロに所属するにあたって\r\n親御さんから書類、貰ってきてくれただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020050,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！\r\nそそそそれが何か！　不備でもありましたか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、これ自体には不備は無いよ\r\nただこれから本格的な活動していくにはさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "直接お会いしてご挨拶、\r\nというか説明と確認をさせてもらいたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご両親とも忙しいってことだったけど\r\nこのまま小糸の活動を進めていくわけにもいかない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり、忙しそうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………はい",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……じゃあ一度電話させてもらって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……っ\r\nあ、えっと……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "確認！　してみます……\r\nわたしから……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうか？　こっちの都合はつけるから、\r\n親御さんの都合のいい日を聞いてみてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020100,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……わ、わかりました…………",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……………………",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういえば、小糸は成績がいいらしいな\r\n勉強とレッスンの両立は大丈夫そうか？",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "012"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……レッスン、やってみてどうだった？\r\n何か困ってることとかあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "………………いえ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういえば\r\nトレーナーが褒めてたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすが幼馴染だけあって、\r\nみんな息があってるって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！\r\nえ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020150,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それ、本当ですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、タイプはバラバラなのに\r\n一体感があるって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺もそう思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020160,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……えへへ",
