    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに小糸は真面目で一生懸命だって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020170,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わぁ…………！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうところが他のメンバーにも\r\nいい影響を与えてるって聞いたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え、えっへん……！\r\nそうなんです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "みんな、わたしがいないとだめなんですよー！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ああ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "頼りにしてるよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "頑張っていこうな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
