  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロデューサーとしても",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "はい……！\r\nみ、みんなのことなら任せてくださいね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸がみんなにいい影響を与えてるって\r\nわかる気がするな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸を見てると頑張ろうって思えるもんな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ええ……それって\r\nどういう意味ですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102200102/1022001020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1022001020220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ちょっと、プロデューサーさーん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
